WEBVTT

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:26.960
Of course you'd be different
from when you first woke up.

00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:30.920
Let me tell you that I have
two transformations left.

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:44.390
Which of us have they come to capture?

00:00:44.390 --> 00:00:48.110
That's obvious.
The one upsetting the order in this city.

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:54.450
How does it feel to be a demon
who gets support from humans?

00:01:02.950 --> 00:01:05.330
Shu! Shu!

00:01:05.620 --> 00:01:07.170
Wake up!

00:01:18.680 --> 00:01:21.970
What are you doing,
making him even weaker?

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:00.530
<i>Save me.</i>

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:02.320
<i>Save me!</i>

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:07.830
<i>Big Brother!</i>

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:08.910
<i>Kisara!</i>

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:12.000
<i>Save Kanna!</i>

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:14.340
<i>That's why I liberated you!</i>

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:34.150
<i>Huh?</i>

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:35.900
<i>What?</i>

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:38.940
<i>I...</i>

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:41.360
<i>What was I doing?</i>

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:45.160
I...

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:48.370
Who...

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:52.920
EPISODE 7
BUT IT'S OKAY, THAT'S ENOUGH

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:50.750
am... I?

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:00.550
How's his condition?

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:03.340
Looks like there's no damage
to his brain.

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:06.220
They said he should wake up
in a few hours.

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:07.300
I see.

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:13.390
It's a good thing
not much happened on your end.

00:04:13.850 --> 00:04:18.150
Unfortunately, it's torn to pieces.
That is, our company's reputation.

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:24.740
Several experts in Demon Extermination teamed
up but still were no match against one human.

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:26.700
There's no way you guys could win.

00:04:27.780 --> 00:04:29.990
Because she is...

00:04:29.990 --> 00:04:34.000
Affiliation: Celestial Abbey - Living Relic
Female.
She is a nun (agent)
in the world's biggest group
of Exorcists: "Celestial Abbey."

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:34.000
She was registered
in the international police database.

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:38.880
Just as President Yugiri pointed out,
she is an agent for the Celestial Abbey.

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:40.550
You already knew that.

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:43.170
Sharon Holygrail.

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:51.390
Apparently, she is one of twelve extraordinary
Exorcists in the Celestial Abbey called "Living Relic."

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:51.390
They are 12 extraordinary Exorcists
out of all Exorcists. Their ranks
from 1 to 12 are decided based
on their accomplishments,
abilities and faith.

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:55.440
That really gets
the chuuni heart in me going.

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:58.770
By the way, her codename
is "Sharon the Chaste."

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:00.900
What part of her is chaste?

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:02.030
Shh!

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:09.780
In any case, I didn't know such a systematic
group of Exorcists existed around here.

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:15.660
Looks like your mom knew about it. I guess that
seat of next company president is still quite far.

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:23.300
The Exorcists of the Celestial Abbey
are systemized.

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:29.930
It's said there are over 100 bases globally
and over 1,000 agents.

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:33.810
Even if we gather up everyone
from the police and every company,

00:05:33.810 --> 00:05:36.850
we still aren't going to stand
a chance against her.

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:39.900
On top of that, they don't work for money.
They work for their doctrines.

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:43.030
They're a group of assassins...

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:47.150
who fight without fear for their own lives
for the sake of Demon Extermination.

00:05:47.150 --> 00:05:55.000
They obtain many followers
by using the idea of saving
the weak and actively
providing support.

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:55.000
Such a group that doesn't accept our laws or money
has arrived here, a city most detached from religion.

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:58.830
However, if it's such a powerful
Demon Extermination organization,

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:01.590
it might be an option
to ask for their assistance.

00:06:02.090 --> 00:06:03.880
And if we did that,

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:08.970
the fact that Demon Hazards are rampant
in this city will become known to the world,

00:06:08.970 --> 00:06:11.760
and we won't be able to avoid
military interference from other nations.

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:15.270
The higher-ups cannot afford
to make that choice.

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:19.690
The higher-ups, huh?

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:40.290
So, how are you related to that woman?

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:42.670
We had a scuffle about three years ago.

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:45.250
That's when you and Shu...

00:06:45.550 --> 00:06:51.140
Right. It was right around
when Shu dumped you and came running to me.

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:54.220
Well, we both got cheated on!

00:06:55.140 --> 00:06:58.810
When Shu liberated me
from my seal in that cave...

00:06:59.230 --> 00:07:00.690
there was one other person.

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:02.400
That woman.

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:07.230
So Shu partnered up with the Celestial Abbey
in order to obtain you?

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:11.320
The two of them forcefully
pinned me down and penetrated me.

00:07:11.320 --> 00:07:13.570
I couldn't do anything about it

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:18.080
and whimpered at the pain
as a hard object entered deep in my abdomen.

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:20.330
Watch how you describe things.

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:26.800
But their partnership
was in order to capture me.

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:32.840
Shu needed me alive,
and the Abbey wanted my dead body.

00:07:32.840 --> 00:07:36.810
But right now,
you're still alive and next to Shu.

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:41.140
That night, Shu took me
with him and ran away.

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:46.020
I'm surprised he was able
to outfox that murder machine.

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:01.210
That woman had a knife.

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:04.080
But Shu used a neurotoxin.

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:06.540
Wait! How did he get
the poison in her body?

00:08:07.670 --> 00:08:11.470
Well, there are several membranes
that can absorb chemicals.

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:13.590
Let me ask you this again!

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:16.850
What part of her is Sharon the Chaste?

00:08:17.850 --> 00:08:22.020
Anyways, it looks like his life isn't in danger,
so I'll be heading home.

00:08:22.430 --> 00:08:25.400
Don't you wanna be at his side
when he wakes up?

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:27.230
We're separated right now.

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:34.700
That reminds me,
I'd forgotten to ask you something.

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:35.700
What?

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:38.950
You guys have a lot of grudges
that you just talked about,

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:43.410
but it seemed like Shu didn't
remember that woman at all.

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:46.830
Well, I'm not surprised.

00:08:47.170 --> 00:08:49.000
That means...

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:50.840
Hold on a second!

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:53.970
Just how many memories of Shu's
past women have you taken from him?

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:56.930
Tell me all of them!
At least the ones you remember!

00:08:57.430 --> 00:09:00.220
Hold on! Wait a minute!

00:09:02.730 --> 00:09:07.520
This is way too much information,
and I can't bring it all under control.

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:30.750
sharon1973: Excuse me for commenting
outside of the follow/follower relationship

00:10:10.460 --> 00:10:14.510
It looks like this is definitely
that nun's doing.

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:16.670
What in the world did she steal?

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:20.140
According to the receipt,
mechanical parts.

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:25.020
If that's really true, there's no reason for her
to steal them before they pass through customs.

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:27.430
What's this?

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:32.360
Is something wrong?

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:35.480
I won't know unless I make
a thorough investigation,

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:38.610
but there's a possibility
that it is muscle fibers of a demon.

00:10:39.070 --> 00:10:40.740
What was that?

00:10:40.740 --> 00:10:45.540
Well, that definitely
wouldn't get past customs safely.

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:53.540
So there's no doubt
it was a body part of a demon?

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:57.130
Yes. And when we looked
at the sender of the package,

00:10:57.130 --> 00:11:00.510
we found out it was a dummy company
for the Celestial Abbey.

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:06.140
In other words, those guys brought forbidden items
close to a port by declaring false contents,

00:11:06.140 --> 00:11:10.600
and then brought it into the city
with brute force without going through customs.

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:12.810
I'd expect nothing less
from the Celestial Abbey.

00:11:12.810 --> 00:11:16.530
They sure smuggled in
something quite disturbing.

00:11:16.900 --> 00:11:21.490
Well, we do use something
that disturbing while it's still alive.

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:27.240
A demon to defeat a demon.

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:33.880
Mr. Ogata's assertions were radical,
but in the end, he proved it by force.

00:11:33.880 --> 00:11:37.000
Nowadays, her presence is a necessity.

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:41.470
Especially for us the police
as we're tied down by the Heavy Weapons Act.

00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:43.640
That aside,

00:11:43.640 --> 00:11:49.850
why did the Celestial Abbey bring in something
so disgusting like the body of a demon?

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:53.600
Perhaps it's basically the same
as what Mr. Ogata thought.

00:11:55.520 --> 00:11:57.650
A demon to defeat a demon!

00:11:58.070 --> 00:11:59.490
Even a shard of flesh...

00:12:00.070 --> 00:12:02.660
can kill one of its kind.

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:06.370
NO ENTRY

00:12:18.460 --> 00:12:19.710
Hey, I'm here!

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:26.220
<i>Did you really come alone?</i>

00:12:26.220 --> 00:12:30.310
Do you think there's a need for me to toy
with strategies against a mere human?

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:31.770
<i>I see.</i>

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:34.770
So why don't you show yourself, as well?

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:36.110
<i>I can't do that.</i>

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:39.360
<i>As I'm nothing more than a human.</i>

00:12:39.780 --> 00:12:43.820
<i>I took every last precaution
to take as many countermeasures as I wished.</i>

00:12:44.110 --> 00:12:48.080
<i>Can you say that telling you this beforehand
will make me fair and square?</i>

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:51.250
What does the Celestial Abbey
have to do in this city?

00:12:51.250 --> 00:12:55.500
<i>No matter what city it is,
we only have one objective.</i>

00:12:58.880 --> 00:13:01.510
That's Demon Extermination, Kisara.

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:28.660
So, is that the "countermeasures
taken with every last precaution?"

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:43.380
A mere lead bullet!

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:45.380
That's right.

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:47.840
Demons are all like that.

00:14:01.690 --> 00:14:02.480
But...

00:14:02.480 --> 00:14:05.530
if it's friendly fire, I can defeat you.

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:07.610
Just like your sword.

00:14:21.750 --> 00:14:23.460
Shu...

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:32.810
<i>Where did your big mouth from earlier go?</i>

00:14:33.220 --> 00:14:34.060
Why...

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:35.930
are you after me right now?

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:40.810
I don't kill people right now!
More like I'm doing the same things you are!

00:14:41.360 --> 00:14:46.280
<i>You don't kill humans because you have
a new sense of philanthropy? That's not it, is it?</i>

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:52.280
<i>I didn't think that a demon
would be sweet-talked by a human guy.</i>

00:14:53.580 --> 00:14:55.080
And what about you?

00:14:55.080 --> 00:14:58.750
You're getting all triggered
because someone stole Shu from you!

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:04.670
<i>Such an irrelevant accusation
not only shocks me, it disgusts me.</i>

00:15:06.590 --> 00:15:08.260
See, you're getting all triggered!

00:16:02.850 --> 00:16:06.860
It's been three years since the last time
you've been beat this bad, Kisara.

00:16:12.110 --> 00:16:15.870
H-H-H-Huh? Are you still sulking?

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:18.990
Oh, is it about that nun?

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:21.910
Come on, it's not like some lover's quarrel!

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:25.250
I've never met her
before in my life! Believe me!

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:27.290
I believe you...

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:29.090
that you don't remember.

00:16:29.090 --> 00:16:32.420
Huh? Um, that means...

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:37.600
I guess there's no use
for us to be arguing here.

00:16:39.560 --> 00:16:43.270
Right now, our priority
is for you to regain your power.

00:16:44.600 --> 00:16:46.360
For what purpose?

00:16:46.940 --> 00:16:48.610
For what purpose?

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:52.190
What's the reason behind you wanting me?

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:54.490
Revenge against demons?

00:16:54.820 --> 00:16:57.160
Regaining a good name for your family?

00:16:57.530 --> 00:16:58.990
Or is it...

00:16:59.290 --> 00:17:01.330
to save your little sister?

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:05.540
Can you not say something
so troublesome right now?

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:06.830
Come on, answer me!

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:09.550
What am I to you?

00:17:09.550 --> 00:17:12.340
Nothing more than a pawn?
A dog that obeys all your orders?

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:13.510
Or—

00:17:20.310 --> 00:17:21.770
If so, what?

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:24.640
Desiring me is your objective?

00:17:24.640 --> 00:17:26.150
Or is it the means—

00:17:31.030 --> 00:17:35.740
Take them... My memories...
Shave them away to the absolute limit!

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:37.320
I don't want to until you answer me!

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:39.580
Oh, jeez!

00:17:39.580 --> 00:17:41.740
Listen up! I'll make it clear, okay?

00:17:41.740 --> 00:17:42.790
If it wasn't you...

00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:45.250
I'd rather die before kissing a demon!

00:18:15.490 --> 00:18:17.110
So you've recovered.

00:18:17.110 --> 00:18:19.410
This is why demons are...

00:18:20.200 --> 00:18:21.330
Right.

00:18:21.330 --> 00:18:24.370
We are not existences
that mere humans can defeat.

00:18:24.370 --> 00:18:26.500
Why don't you stop
your futile struggles?

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:42.760
Are you still going to fight for that man?

00:18:42.760 --> 00:18:44.390
If so, what?

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:50.440
He's a loser who uses every woman
he interacts with to get what he wants.

00:18:51.150 --> 00:18:53.270
He's just like me.

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:55.070
You're right.

00:18:55.400 --> 00:18:58.110
Yep, I'm being deceived.

00:18:58.700 --> 00:19:02.070
Most definitely, I'm being deceived.

00:19:02.990 --> 00:19:04.160
But it's okay!

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:05.830
That's enough!

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:11.380
If he's going to deceive me all the way
until he dies, that's enough for me!

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:14.500
I'm the one who turned Shu
into someone like that!

00:19:24.640 --> 00:19:27.430
I'm the demon who's causing his downfall!

00:19:27.430 --> 00:19:29.190
A symbol of his downfall!

00:19:30.980 --> 00:19:35.360
That's why I don't need anything
other than what shapes him!

00:19:35.360 --> 00:19:38.030
I don't need anything
other than what is really precious!

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:51.080
Every other woman can be destroyed!

00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:56.130
You nutcase!

00:20:18.110 --> 00:20:20.900
Wasn't that going too far against a human?

00:20:20.900 --> 00:20:25.950
If I treated guys from the Abbey as humans,
I'd never have enough lives.

00:20:27.950 --> 00:20:32.960
But why did this Celestial Abbey come
to this city at this particular point in time?

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:35.420
Oh, that's... Well...

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:37.340
You might not know about it,

00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:40.420
but there was something between me
and that woman named Sharon.

00:20:40.420 --> 00:20:43.180
Was it simply a personal reason like that?

00:20:43.180 --> 00:20:44.590
What do you mean?

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:47.970
She tends to make things personal,

00:20:47.970 --> 00:20:51.850
but I thought she always prioritized
missions from the Abbey the most.

00:20:54.230 --> 00:20:56.560
Huh? Why'd I say that?

00:20:56.560 --> 00:20:59.320
I've never met her before, right?

00:21:00.320 --> 00:21:02.950
She really is tenacious.

00:21:02.950 --> 00:21:04.070
Huh?

00:21:04.570 --> 00:21:07.700
Well, how about we go home
and have dinner?

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:11.950
But it's been a while for you, right?

00:21:12.200 --> 00:21:16.130
What are you talking about? I've been meddling
in your affairs every day this whole time!

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:19.500
Is that really so?

00:21:19.500 --> 00:21:20.840
That's right!

00:21:20.840 --> 00:21:24.340
Each and every day, I work myself
down to the bone to serve you!

00:21:24.340 --> 00:21:25.680
Well...

00:21:25.680 --> 00:21:27.470
you're free to think that way,

00:21:27.470 --> 00:21:32.180
but I'd like you to slightly refrain
from blabbing to everyone around us.

00:21:36.480 --> 00:21:37.150
Oh.

00:23:12.910 --> 00:23:16.750
Oh, all right.
I'll explain it to you again.

00:23:17.370 --> 00:23:20.750
Soon, a demon will descend onto this city.

00:23:20.750 --> 00:23:23.960
This one is quite different from the
Demonically Possessed that's lying around.

00:23:23.960 --> 00:23:27.050
It will not fit any of the categories
for your Demon Hazards.

00:23:27.050 --> 00:23:29.470
Something beyond
your imagination, so to say.

00:23:30.300 --> 00:23:34.970
We the Celestial Abbey
simply came here to stop that.

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:37.350
That's impossible for you guys.

00:23:37.350 --> 00:23:43.020
There's no way people who are colluding
with demons can stop the real Demon Hazard.

00:23:43.860 --> 00:23:45.520
That's why we'll do it.

00:23:46.440 --> 00:23:49.450
And we will make sure
you guys won't get in the way.

00:23:49.950 --> 00:23:53.740
Even if it means
the destruction of this city.

00:23:55.620 --> 00:24:00.040
EPISODE 8
THE UNWANTED TRUTH

00:23:56.620 --> 00:23:59.080
"The Unwanted Truth."
